{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_032_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca828b92dabb1442652ef0ca980136c5e030487cfd88d6b9937e39ce4c7d52a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:564b773fd15b2d6865a17b1fdff90046eed96b79ac1950204efea82e83b1c8df",
      "text": "无法服输的对局",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d68f9cebef14fde2f349fd0fd1837ccb833447eeccca7e435e8b67018dd8ba0",
      "text": "某天，直央在练习前前往熟悉的\n将棋俱乐部。随后，\n制作人出现在了那里。\n直央在制作人的注视下，\n下起了一盘将棋……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:564b773fd15b2d6865a17b1fdff90046eed96b79ac1950204efea82e83b1c8df",
      "text": "无法服输的对局",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:743dfa670ce04655b1b69cabe97908900b9f84d022de83b35dea829a382329e4",
      "text": "好……来得挺早。\n这样的话，练习前还能下一盘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f829fe8b5dfad9cbd654b2e4bcd143c33488ea0f2d8d0462717415e705657a4b",
      "text": "（将棋俱乐部里，会有谁在呢……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1019ce4b47eef3a713fadd4214c650d9dabe3282f4934940b66ce01273f4681",
      "text": "（上次还没能对局时间就到了，\n今天要是能下一盘就好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:417f1bc47b0788df89dc2d313591c7fb09c4cf4fbad747af679e7f2332e09737",
      "text": "书上读到的那步棋我也想试试……\n中飞车是基础，真想能熟练掌握啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3628352f36305c453b5e1e53344decc44d14221d9a17a9972f8e88216f467306",
      "text": "将棋俱乐部里也有很擅长进攻的人，\n容易走成筑起防守阵型的局面……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3533a2cb30df0c07c00b7d8938327bf4f5bd65e0869211842d38f08fb7059a0c",
      "text": "……啊，不过也有很擅长穴熊围的人，\n要是和那个人对局的话，说不定能学学进攻的方法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000070:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbffd1c007abff49f2a50fc30f2094d1638984442ca88c5046647f5a0d2669ad",
      "text": "将棋俱乐部",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:439e44a82b28f76c2661e4e65537f0f3963df49beaed16276f0938471f86a7d2",
      "text": "你好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b42b66f8324709d6b53df14f175b0bc741b70d409610735246e3ec050e3f0c2f",
      "text": "直央君，欢迎啊。\n今天来得真早。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcb12781e54394a8b7cd10781b1efb6bd625c583c9a740b34c2b4b2082f138f2",
      "text": "是的。请问现在有人能和我下一盘吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5a0b4bbf34a0ea4eed190536813a932334b547b9e176ee90f13551b980d0b27",
      "text": "既然这样，那就老夫来陪你下一盘吧。\n那边的座位空着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43",
      "text": "请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
